# Day 14: Advanced Flow Orchestration & Automation Governance

Welcome to the Day 14 project repository! This module shifts the focus to managing complex, multi-branch declarative architecture on the Salesforce platform. Below is a deep-dive breakdown of advanced approval engine patterns, branching flow logic mechanics, and the governance frameworks required to prevent system conflict in enterprise orgs.

